  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Oito de Copas fala de partida, busca e sentido.",
      "Ele representa saber a hora de deixar algo bom para trás.",
      "O foco dele é: seguir para onde o coração leva."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Eight of Cups speaks of leaving, searching and meaning.",
      "It stands for knowing when to leave something good behind.",
      "Its focus: going where the heart leads."
